n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">$19.9/Stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$265.2/Stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$331.6/Stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.90.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The heavenly tree is a large pale yellow tree that has light rays emanating from its leaves and emits a bright yellow glow.\n</p><p>This tree only spawns for a period of 24 hours<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>, starting the morning of Saturday<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> (12:00 AM, EST). This tree can spawn anywhere on the map, Although, it tends to spawn in more barren environments (Including underwater). However, any trees spawned before this time will remain until they’re either harvested or die. It is highly recommended to get a <a href=\"/wiki/UFO\" title=\"UFO\">UFO</a> and fly to the <a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_Shrine\" title=\"Heavenly Shrine\">Heavenly Shrine</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Snowy_peaks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowy peaks\">Snowy peaks</a>. Alternatively a Freecam can be used. If one of the pedestals light up, that means a Heavenly Tree is in that direction.\n</p><p>(IMPORTANT): In order to harvest the tree, it requires you to use at minimum a <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Axe\" title=\"Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tip\">Tip</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/19/Image_2026-04-12_144342341.png/revision/latest?cb=20260412064415\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A Helicopter carrying a Living Heavenly Tree\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"87\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Image 2026-04-12 144342341.png\" data-image-key=\"Image_2026-04-12_144342341.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/19/Image_2026-04-12_144342341.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260412064415\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/19/Image_2026-04-12_144342341.png/revision/latest?cb=20260412064415\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A Helicopter carrying a Living Heavenly Tree\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/19/Image_2026-04-12_144342341.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260412064415\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"87\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Image 2026-04-12 144342341.png\" data-image-key=\"Image_2026-04-12_144342341.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/19/Image_2026-04-12_144342341.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260412064415\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Image_2026-04-12_144342341.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A Helicopter carrying a Living Heavenly Tree</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Heavenly Trees can sometimes spawn in awkward hard to reach places. Due to this it is recommended that you use a helicopter and its winch, added on update v.112.0 - April 11th 2026, to transport said trees easily.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2><p>\nOriginally this tree was going to spawn on Fridays, but a poll made on 10/3/2025 changed that, it now spawns on ONLY Saturdays<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></p><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/1400637897945645266/1411376160914538506\">https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/1400637897945645266/1411376160914538506</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/894303481421262923/1425627220650754200\">https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/894303481421262923/1425627220650754200</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/894303481421262923/1423637719388651553\">https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/894303481421262923/1423637719388651553</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903074443\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.089 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 128/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 572/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 25/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1750/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019510/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.590      1 -total\n 89.54%   30.077      1 Template:Wood\n 10.33%    3.470      1 Template:Stub\n  4.37%    1.468      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4318-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903074443 and revision id 21285. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Stubs"],"links":[{"title":"Category:Stubs","exists":true},{"title":"Heavenly Shrine","exists":true},{"title":"Refined Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Snowy peaks","exists":true},{"title":"UFO","exists":true}],"images":["Heavenly_tree.png","Heavenly_log.png","Heavenly_log_sanded.png","Heavenly_plank.png","Image_2026-04-12_144342341.png"]}
